      "name": "Client SDKs for six languages are published at 0.1.0 as…",
      "text": "Client SDKs for six languages are published at 0.1.0 as early access releases, together with the Grid packages `@nulldull/grid-core` and `@nulldull/grid-react` on npm. The SDK source is open under the MIT license at [github.com/doubco/nulldull-sdks](https://github.com/doubco/nulldull-sdks).",
